libg722
------------------------------------------
The G.722 module is a bit exact implementation of the ITU G.722 specification
for all three specified bit rates - 64000bps, 56000bps and 48000bps. It passes
the ITU tests.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libg722-devel-1.2.8-1bl1
  libg722_1-1.2.8-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.8-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/sippy/libg722

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/sippy/libg722/archive/refs/tags/v1.2.8.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libg722-1.2.8-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libg722-1.2.8-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libg722-1.2.8-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libg722-1.2.8-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libg722_1-1.2.8-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libg722-devel-1.2.8-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libg722)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libg722.README
  /usr/share/doc/libg722/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libg722/README.md

(libg722_1)
  /usr/bin/cygg722-1.dll

(libg722-devel)
  /usr/include/g722.h
  /usr/include/g722_codec.h
  /usr/include/g722_decoder.h
  /usr/include/g722_encoder.h
  /usr/lib/libg722.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libg722.pc

